    <article class="case--content-block">
      <h4 class="section-label-x2">03 / Internal Websites</h4>
      <p>
        Parallel to public initiatives, I architected and hand-built dozens of
        custom internal websites and restricted portals supporting critical
        American Indian and Alaska Native health initiatives. Developed prior to
        the widespread adoption of modern Content Management Systems (CMS),
        these standalone platforms required bespoke front-end engineering and
        rigorous information architecture. I took full ownership of translating
        complex healthcare workflows into clean, secure, and accessible internal
        systems that empowered agency staff and healthcare providers nationwide.
      </p>
